WEBVTT

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:09.833
Hello.

00:00:10.233 --> 00:00:11.799
I have a question for you:

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:14.899
Have you got something you're the best at?

00:00:15.733 --> 00:00:18.766
Not just good or better than your friends at,

00:00:19.633 --> 00:00:21.399
but the best of all?

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.933
I can draw and paint quite well.

00:00:25.166 --> 00:00:27.666
But some of my friends are better than me.

00:00:27.666 --> 00:00:32.332
And my friend Joan, well, she's the most amazing painter!

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:35.700
I can play the piano very well.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.433
But my friend Carlos plays better than me.

00:00:38.433 --> 00:00:42.633
But, definitely, my friend Amelie is the best of all of us!

00:00:43.533 --> 00:00:46.033
And she is the fastest player, too.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.166
I'm pretty good at most things.

00:00:49.433 --> 00:00:52.233
But I guess the only thing I'm the best at

00:00:52.233 --> 00:00:54.166
is having the best friends!

00:00:55.466 --> 00:00:59.466
OK. Let me know if you're the best at anything!

00:00:59.466 --> 00:01:02.566
Leave a note in the comments. Bye.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.966
Which language does the vlogger use?

00:01:12.866 --> 00:01:17.132
We use superlative adjectives to compare more than two things.

00:01:19.733 --> 00:01:25.866
To form the superlative of short adjectives, we use <i>the</i> plus <i>–est.</i>

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:29.933
And she's the fastest player, too.

00:01:32.433 --> 00:01:35.266
To form the superlative of long adjectives,

00:01:35.266 --> 00:01:38.299
we use <i>the most</i> plus adjective.

00:01:39.366 --> 00:01:41.866
Well, she's the most amazing painter!

00:01:44.766 --> 00:01:49.132
<i>The best</i> and <i>the worst</i> are irregular adjectives.

00:01:51.366 --> 00:01:53.799
Have you got something you're the best at?

00:02:01.966 --> 00:02:02.466
Use it!

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:06.766
Change the sentences to use superlatives.

00:02:21.466 --> 00:02:23.466
<i>He's the fastest rider.</i>

00:02:24.433 --> 00:02:25.633
Now you try.

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:40.000
<i>He is the <b>tallest</b> of his brothers.</i>

00:02:53.733 --> 00:02:56.033
<i>She is the <b>most amazing</b> singer.</i>

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:12.766
<i>The apple is <b>the healthiest</b> snack.</i>